WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.200
[door chime]

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.400
MAYA: Morning! You look like
something the cat dragged in.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.800
THEO: I pulled an all-nighter
fixing the oven. Again.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.500
- Did it work?
- Define "work".

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.600
MAYA: So we're back to square one.
<i>Fantastic.</i>

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.400
THEO: Hey, I'm not throwing in the towel
just yet.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.300
MAYA: The inspector comes at noon.
No pressure.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.900
THEO: Relax. I've got it covered.
Mostly.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.000
(oven beeping)

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.600
MAYA: That beep is not
a good sign, is it?

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.700
THEO: It's fine. It's just
letting off a little steam.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.800
MAYA: Like you after
the Henderson order?

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.500
THEO: We agreed never
to speak of the Henderson order.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.600
MAYA: Fine. But if this goes south,
you're breaking the news to Gran.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.000
♪ radio playing softly ♪
